OL,3,GNEWSAThree sisters who drowned in sea
OL,4,Aoff Brighton took own lives, inquest
OL,5,Afinds
OL,6,
OL,7,FAt an inquest, senior coroner Penelope
OL,8,FSchofield said the women faced adverse
OL,9,Fsea conditions when they entered the
OL,10,Fwater off Brighton beach and could not
OL,11,Fswim.
